{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Discord-style session-resume client. Runs as an actor so callers don’t"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"have to worry about thread-safety; you can poke it from your transport"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"task and from the main actor freely."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"actor"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SessionCoordinator"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Architecture","anchor":"Architecture","level":1,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The coordinator owns three pieces of state:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The in-memory "},{"code":"state","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (handshaking \/ replaying \/ live \/ disconnected).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A persistent "},{"code":"(sessionId, lastSeq)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" cursor in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SessionStorage"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A heartbeat timer that fires while the connection is healthy.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"It does ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}]},{"text":" own the connection itself — that’s your transport’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"problem. The coordinator just decides what to send when you tell it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"“the connection is open” or “I received this frame”."}]},{"anchor":"Lifecycle-the-seven-calls-youll-make","type":"heading","level":1,"text":"Lifecycle (the seven calls you’ll make)"},{"code":["\/\/ 1. On WebSocket c